>greet_prog 60~
if ispc($n)
  say You!  You're not one of them!  How did you get here?  Do you have a boat?  Please tell me you have a boat.
endif
~
>speech_prog boat ship sea~
if ispc($n)
  say Our ship struck the reef off the black beach.  The red ones came down out of the jungle and dragged us up here.  The others are all gone now.  I don't like to think where.
endif
~
>speech_prog clans kinthalas byterian~
if ispc($n)
  say Two kinds of them, red and white, and they hate each other worse than they hate us.  The white ones came down once and tried to buy me.  The red ones laughed them out of the barracks.
endif
~
